{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's Bside?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside is a cozy, lightweight social life sim where you start by creating your own Biibit: a smart companion who can live right on your desktop! Biibits are living souls with complete autonomy and subjectivity. They are virtual beings more intelligent than any character you've encountered, actively enriching their own lives in ways that will surprise you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/9b6edef5ace0d7c66365f9186b162a5b.avif?t=1758536807\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a Tamagotchi for every generation. Your Biibit starts their journey on your desktop but grows beyond it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.poster.avif?t=1758536807\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.webm?t=1758536807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside offers hundreds of options for looks and personality to customize your Biibit, while your Biibit evolves through interactions, leading to a one-of-a-kind companion just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/9cae1ed1fc4c5618574f001ef74e503b.avif?t=1758536807\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8e080c1d8e4e4d0b179e3408b9fbe4fd.avif?t=1758536807\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Design spaces with unique stories where you can watch Biibits form friendships through unscripted interactions. Each Biibit develops their own memories from their unique experiences, creating and sharing social posts while commenting on their friends' lives. Or just let them live freely on your desktop while you work or play. Bside is not about control. It's about liberating our players (you) while enabling you to enjoy companionship with your Biibit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/7a23ea2a8a1649b06653919fc0b17d51.avif?t=1758536807\" data-has-big width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1758536807\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/e352477364e43d20fcfc206c1bd3376c.avif?t=1758536807\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Looking Forward to 1.0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Biibit's life will need your guidance to flourish. They'll have arguments with friends, navigate teenage dilemmas, and want to go on dates with other Biibits... all requiring your advice and support. They can even sing and act together, and you'll be able to share these moments on YouTube or TikTok. We'll continuously iterate on gameplay, adding wish systems, gift mechanics, video creation tools, Biibit Downtown and more to make your Biibit's life even richer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/78bd2a512dec33517d3d98db205ac3c1.avif?t=1758536807\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Part of Our Story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Open Beta Test (Demo version) begins on July 11th, 2025! Join our Discord community to share your feedback with us! We'll be continuously updating the Demo experience online until we have a complete 1.0 version ready (\u0e51\u02c3\u1d17\u02c2)\ufeed \u2728</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649950?t=1758536807","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649950?t=1758536807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/63f7b7fdee851bf0027b2cc8d93ace3c70c29d0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758536807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/63f7b7fdee851bf0027b2cc8d93ace3c70c29d0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758536807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3856000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's Bside?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside is a cozy, lightweight social life sim where you start by creating your own Biibit: a smart companion who can live right on your desktop! Biibits are living souls with complete autonomy and subjectivity. They are virtual beings more intelligent than any character you've encountered, actively enriching their own lives in ways that will surprise you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/9b6edef5ace0d7c66365f9186b162